 collab/parity.json                        |  8 ++---
 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md                      | 28 ++++++++++++-----
 docs/FEATURES.md                          |  8 ++---
 docs/FILM.md                              |  2 +-
 docs/SETTINGS.md                          |  2 +-
